Z||000001||DXR_DAD||09-01-2000||08:10 PM||||???? What type of changes do you want to make, and more important WHY????. There is so much you can do with the Fiero interior: Mr. Mike's is a start, I'm doing a color change now and some other mods?? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">Real Carbon Fiber! I must say it's looking GOOD too!!. Use the search and you will find lots of info on interior upgrades, mods, replacements custom dash and so on.<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||5
Z||000002||Monkeyman||09-01-2000||11:34 PM||||I would seriously doubt if there's any other car whose interior would be a direct bolt in.  Depending on what you want to change, you can do anything from adding a glove box to changing the color to purchasing a custom dash/console to fabbing your own designed dash/console (that's what I'm starting to do now).  The possibilities are endless.  There are some interesting custom dashes out there but be prepared to spend some money.  PISA has a decent wrap around dash, Archie has one and Scott Tilden is supposed to be getting ready to produce one designed by Eddy Snaauw (damn nice looking!).||||reg||1
