Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||09-05-2000||10:31 PM||||I've always liked the older Cavalier dashes.. I might try to make one based on that design sometime. should be easier than actually bolting in a real Cavalier dash!<P>HOWEVER.... Gary's Custom Exotics had a Finale for sale with a Bonneville dash in it... it was modified... but it fit!<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
